  "theorem": {
    "statement": "For E11 core slice with capacity m and block (R_j, C_i): e_B + e_C ≤ m-3 where e_B = rank(B_s)-3, e_C = rank(C_s)-3. Cap-3: two-sided purity. Cap-4: one-sided purity.",
